Hi Maria,

good to hear from you. Just briefly for lack of time:

On Apr 7, 2009, at 5:28 AM, Maria Carminati wrote:
> Generalized linear mixed model fit using Laplace
> Formula: poresp ~ primec * nounrepc + (1 | subject) + (1 | item)
