From: rlevy-J8UlxMCpGvdVdeU8dOWy+g at public.gmane.org (Roger Levy)
Date: Sat, 11 Apr 2009 12:45:46 -0700
Subject: Re: residualization of a three-way contrast
In-Reply-To: <6CBB8FED-426F-4DC7-8A65-760A450D7A6C@gmail.com>
