From Matthew.Roberts-5WhEfG1TI8k at public.gmane.org  Mon Apr 20 10:16:58 2009
From: Matthew.Roberts-5WhEfG1TI8k at public.gmane.org (Matthew Roberts)
Date: Mon, 20 Apr 2009 11:16:58 +0100
Subject: Re: Collinearity and condition number
